### What steps can reproduce the bug?

Adding `onExit` to the options of Bun.spawn screws up inferred types and sets them to default options.
Using the [Bun.spawn input example snippet](https://bun.sh/docs/api/spawn#input-stream):
```ts
const proc = Bun.spawn(["cat"], {
  stdin: "pipe"
});

